    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPLASH-Paintball</strong> brings the true paintball experience to PC: featuring licensed gear from renowned manufacturers, realistic ballistics, detailed tournament fields, and open scenario maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from various game modes</strong> like Speedball, Capture the Flag, or the action-packed Arcade mode \u2013 <strong>play solo against bots or online with friends</strong>. With smooth controls and agile movements, every round feels like you're on a real field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular free updates</strong> continually expand the game, inspired by feedback from the community. Be part of it from the start and contribute your ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This and much more awaits you...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed gear and equipment from renowned manufacturers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real world tournament fields and scenario maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic ball and bunker physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics down to the smallest detail</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPLASH-Paintball isn\u2019t new to everyone \u2013 a growing player base is already\u00a0active on other platforms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPLASH-Paintball</strong> brings the true paintball experience to PC: featuring licensed gear from renowned manufacturers, realistic ballistics, detailed tournament fields, and open scenario maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from various game modes</strong> like Speedball, Capture the Flag, or the action-packed Arcade mode \u2013 <strong>play solo against bots or online with friends</strong>. With smooth controls and agile movements, every round feels like you're on a real field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular free updates</strong> continually expand the game, inspired by feedback from the community. Be part of it from the start and contribute your ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This and much more awaits you...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed gear and equipment from renowned manufacturers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real world tournament fields and scenario maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic ball and bunker physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics down to the smallest detail</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPLASH-Paintball isn\u2019t new to everyone \u2013 a growing player base is already\u00a0active on other platforms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "SPLASH-Paintball delivers most authentic FPS paintball experience with licensed gear from real brands, true-to-life ballistics, and detailed tournament and scenario maps. Play Speedball, Capture the Flag, or Arcade, solo or online with friends. Regular updates from community feedback keep it fresh.",
